1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,400
John von Neumann dies and goes to heaven.

2
00:00:02,825 --> 00:00:04,488
He gets to ask God one question:

3
00:00:04,962 --> 00:00:06,363
is the Riemann hypothesis true?

4
00:00:06,775 --> 00:00:07,562
God says yes.

5
00:00:07,975 --> 00:00:09,238
Then von Neumann asks:

6
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,150
but how do you know?

7
00:00:10,562 --> 00:00:11,188
God says:

8
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:12,950
I know where all the zeros are.

9
00:00:13,375 --> 00:00:14,725
That's not enough for von Neumann,

10
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,612
and he ends up in the other place.

11
00:00:17,025 --> 00:00:18,988
It's from a play written by a mathematician

12
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,188
in the nineteen fifties,

13
00:00:20,488 --> 00:00:22,175
and it has never been more relevant.

14
00:00:22,588 --> 00:00:25,662
AI just proved results mathematicians never expected to

15
00:00:25,675 --> 00:00:25,988
see.

16
00:00:26,412 --> 00:00:27,988
But as one of them told Lex Fridman:

17
00:00:28,375 --> 00:00:29,700
math is not the fact.

18
00:00:30,112 --> 00:00:30,662
It's the why.

19
00:00:31,088 --> 00:00:33,412
The full animated breakdown is on my channel.
